WEBVTT

00:01:54.760 --> 00:01:56.380
Where's Rosette?

00:01:57.170 --> 00:02:00.550
Unfortunately,
her whereabouts are still unknown.

00:02:00.550 --> 00:02:03.470
The police are working with us too,
but under these circumstances,

00:02:03.470 --> 00:02:06.390
we're short on manpower.

00:02:06.390 --> 00:02:09.850
Civic faculties are completely paralyzed.

00:02:09.850 --> 00:02:13.270
The situation is that
everyone in the city saw Chrono,

00:02:13.270 --> 00:02:17.150
so rumors about the end are flying about.

00:02:17.150 --> 00:02:20.660
Ironically,
all the churches are flourishing though.

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:24.120
It's not just 'Cisco.

00:02:24.120 --> 00:02:27.410
The disturbance is spreading out
throughout the entirety of America!

00:02:27.410 --> 00:02:29.330
This is the worst, isn't it?

00:02:29.330 --> 00:02:34.590
We can't even guess what
Aion's next move is going to be.

00:02:34.590 --> 00:02:38.880
Can't you infer anything
from Azmaria's testimony?

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:40.890
It is difficult.

00:02:40.890 --> 00:02:43.300
Even for you?

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:44.470
Yes...

00:02:44.470 --> 00:02:48.640
Minister, did you know
that Rosette was an Apostle?

00:02:49.890 --> 00:02:55.400
My honest answer
to that is, I was never told.

00:02:55.400 --> 00:02:59.820
Ultimately, it seems that
was all my position merited.

00:03:16.460 --> 00:03:17.550
Older sister!

00:03:17.550 --> 00:03:19.720
Miss Satella! Your older sister is...

00:03:29.680 --> 00:03:33.650
Lord Joshua,
I will give you power right now.

00:03:33.650 --> 00:03:36.570
Do you want a jewel, older sister?

00:03:41.110 --> 00:03:43.030
What are you intending on doing?

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:45.570
They are unnecessary.

00:03:45.570 --> 00:03:50.250
The blood-colored jewel
does not befit Lord Joshua.

00:03:50.250 --> 00:03:54.790
I am Lord Joshua's older sister.
I will decide what he needs.

00:03:54.790 --> 00:03:59.800
What are you saying?
You're not his older sister! You're mine!

00:04:00.970 --> 00:04:03.380
Who are you?

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:06.850
Please don't interfere!

00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:12.140
Lord Joshua...

00:04:12.140 --> 00:04:17.820
Who are you? Where's my big sister?

00:04:28.450 --> 00:04:30.410
My older sister has gone to sleep.

00:04:32.960 --> 00:04:35.330
She doesn't see me.

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:38.960
It looks like Joshua
has become her everything.

00:04:38.960 --> 00:04:42.010
Well, your older sister's body is...

00:04:45.300 --> 00:04:48.890
If only I had some spiritual power left.

00:04:48.890 --> 00:04:51.220
You? It couldn't be...

00:04:51.220 --> 00:04:54.810
Yes, it's disappeared.

00:04:54.810 --> 00:05:00.270
No matter how much I wish,
or sing, nothing happens.

00:05:00.270 --> 00:05:04.700
Why did God grant me this power?

00:05:04.700 --> 00:05:10.580
Aion killed the Apostles
when the ritual was finished.

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:14.710
It might be that I could have died there.

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:19.840
But I'm still alive!

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:25.260
My life, which was supposed
to have ended, is still going.

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:28.300
It's all right for me to live, isn't it?

00:05:29.890 --> 00:05:35.770
Of course it is. You have to
live for Steiner's sake too. Okay?

00:05:38.980 --> 00:05:40.440
Lord Duffau...

00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:43.320
How did it go?

00:05:43.320 --> 00:05:45.150
We've found him.

00:05:45.150 --> 00:05:48.610
I see, and the holy woman?

00:05:48.610 --> 00:05:51.620
She's with him.
Will you tell the Magdalene Order?

00:05:52.530 --> 00:05:56.210
The humans right now
are too timid to be of use.

00:05:56.210 --> 00:05:59.250
They were of less use
than I thought they would be.

00:06:04.260 --> 00:06:05.590
Chrono...

00:06:09.220 --> 00:06:11.640
Is it all right to leave things this way?

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:20.150
You love her, don't you?

00:06:34.620 --> 00:06:37.540
You're Magdalene, the Holy Woman, right?

00:06:38.410 --> 00:06:42.380
I've been waiting
for you, inside this bird cage.

00:06:45.710 --> 00:06:48.590
I've wanted to meet you, all this time.

00:06:51.010 --> 00:06:56.270
Hey, Minister, if we go
to the Order, will Chrono be there?

00:06:56.270 --> 00:06:57.730
Chrono?

00:06:57.730 --> 00:07:03.270
The person in my dreams.
He's dark, tall and very frightening.

00:07:03.270 --> 00:07:05.230
But he's crying.

00:07:05.940 --> 00:07:10.950
Why is he crying? If I meet him,
do you think he will tell me?

00:07:10.950 --> 00:07:14.740
If it's a dream you had,
then you'll meet him, some day.

00:07:14.740 --> 00:07:18.040
When that time comes, definitely.

00:07:18.040 --> 00:07:21.620
The time has come, hasn't it, Chrono?

00:07:21.620 --> 00:07:24.130
Why do you know my name?

00:07:31.260 --> 00:07:32.840
A devil?

00:07:32.840 --> 00:07:34.680
Back away from the Holy Woman!

00:07:38.930 --> 00:07:41.270
Now, Holy Woman, this way!

00:07:42.520 --> 00:07:44.060
In six point two seconds,

00:07:44.060 --> 00:07:46.320
he will slash down at
your shoulder from above.

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:52.820
It's all right, because
as long as I'm here, they won't fire.

00:07:52.820 --> 00:07:54.570
Release the Holy Woman!

00:08:14.010 --> 00:08:15.970
So you can see the future.

00:08:17.180 --> 00:08:19.640
That's why you came
to take me away, right?

00:08:20.810 --> 00:08:24.230
I am fated to carve
the Seven Sorrows of the Virgin Mary

00:08:24.230 --> 00:08:27.360
into the path I walk.

00:08:27.360 --> 00:08:31.400
You want that fate, right, Mr. Sinner?

00:08:31.400 --> 00:08:32.320
What?

00:08:34.110 --> 00:08:36.700
Don't look at me like that.

00:08:36.700 --> 00:08:40.080
You're afraid of
hurting people, aren't you?

00:08:40.080 --> 00:08:43.500
There was no reason
to hurt anyone earlier.

00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:47.670
But someday, you will hurt someone.

00:08:47.670 --> 00:08:49.590
You will have
no choice but to hurt someone.

00:08:53.010 --> 00:08:58.550
Not wanting to hurt anyone
is children's nonsense, Chrono.

00:08:58.550 --> 00:09:02.560
It's natural for beings
with hearts to hurt one another.

00:09:02.560 --> 00:09:04.060
That's harsh.

00:09:05.060 --> 00:09:08.230
If you protect someone,
then you will, without exception,

00:09:08.230 --> 00:09:10.070
hurt someone else.

00:09:10.070 --> 00:09:12.400
If you live, it is something
that is going to happen.

00:09:14.070 --> 00:09:16.950
Everything is supposed
to have been for the dream.

00:09:18.820 --> 00:09:23.250
It is because you were prepared
for that that you came and took me away.

00:09:24.830 --> 00:09:26.960
So you can see through everything?

00:09:26.960 --> 00:09:30.960
Just events, I can't read minds.

00:09:38.260 --> 00:09:39.430
Thank you.

00:09:57.150 --> 00:09:59.990
What happened to your horns?

00:10:00.950 --> 00:10:03.040
With this, I am free!

00:10:03.660 --> 00:10:06.330
If you do that,
then you can't retain any Astral.

00:10:06.330 --> 00:10:07.870
You'll die!

00:10:09.170 --> 00:10:11.920
Someday they will become unnecessary.

00:10:11.920 --> 00:10:14.170
For that reason we have the Holy Woman.

00:10:37.490 --> 00:10:40.070
If you don't have your horns,you'll die.

00:10:40.070 --> 00:10:42.030
That's why you're here.

00:10:42.030 --> 00:10:43.700
It'll be ready soon.

00:10:44.830 --> 00:10:46.080
What's that?

00:10:46.080 --> 00:10:48.830
An Astral focusing control unit.

00:10:48.830 --> 00:10:51.120
In layman's terms,
a replacement for our horns.

00:10:51.120 --> 00:10:55.550
Although you end up
requiring a source of Astral.

00:10:55.550 --> 00:10:58.130
For example,
a human being's life or something.

00:10:59.170 --> 00:11:01.510
And the ceremony?

00:11:01.510 --> 00:11:03.640
It depends on
the rotation of the stars, you see.

00:11:03.640 --> 00:11:06.560
I haven't fully deciphered
the Book of Atonement,

00:11:06.560 --> 00:11:09.600
but if we go ahead
and connect the legends together,

00:11:09.600 --> 00:11:11.440
I guess the rest will be up
to our own resourcefulness.

00:11:12.230 --> 00:11:14.270
Does it not hurt?

00:11:14.270 --> 00:11:17.110
The pain opens my eyes.

00:11:19.860 --> 00:11:23.160
The horizon of freedom
has widened yet another step.

00:11:23.160 --> 00:11:24.240
Can't you tell?

00:11:34.670 --> 00:11:38.010
There's something I want to ask you.

00:11:38.010 --> 00:11:40.590
You know of us.

00:11:40.590 --> 00:11:43.800
Are you looking at the end of the dream?

00:11:45.180 --> 00:11:47.220
The lights of the city...

00:11:47.220 --> 00:11:51.770
I like to look at the city
when the sun is setting.

00:11:55.230 --> 00:12:01.070
The lights of life...
Each and every light has a life.

00:12:01.070 --> 00:12:05.240
And a family.
They're proof that the people are alive.

00:12:05.240 --> 00:12:08.490
But the proof that I'm alive is...

00:12:11.790 --> 00:12:13.540
Stigmata?!

00:12:13.540 --> 00:12:18.420
That's right,
the mark of those chosen by God.

00:12:18.420 --> 00:12:21.510
Ever since this mark was cut into me,

00:12:21.510 --> 00:12:24.840
I've gained knowledge
of the future and the past.

00:12:24.840 --> 00:12:27.220
And in my memory,

00:12:27.220 --> 00:12:30.970
nothing but thousands of past
and future events overlap one another.

00:12:33.190 --> 00:12:37.150
I don't remember
anything from when I was little.

00:12:37.150 --> 00:12:39.070
And nothing about my parents either.

00:12:40.070 --> 00:12:45.160
Dreams of happy weddings,
dreams of the instant of horrible death...

00:12:47.780 --> 00:12:50.990
I carry them all as sensations
that are no different from reality.

00:12:50.990 --> 00:12:53.290
All of the events
that will occur on this planet

00:12:53.290 --> 00:12:56.120
are engraved into my memory.

00:12:57.830 --> 00:13:01.130
There are so many of those memories

00:13:01.130 --> 00:13:04.260
that my true self became
lost somewhere along the way.

00:13:05.260 --> 00:13:09.760
An empty vessel that can be filled
with anything, but contains nothing.

00:13:11.140 --> 00:13:12.890
That is what I am.

00:13:15.940 --> 00:13:18.730
Even still, there is just one...

00:13:18.730 --> 00:13:21.820
A dream I remember that I've
seen countless times since I was small,

00:13:21.820 --> 00:13:24.070
a dream for me alone.

00:13:24.820 --> 00:13:27.360
Inside of my cloistered, indistinct self,

00:13:27.360 --> 00:13:29.990
the only certain thing about my past.

00:13:29.990 --> 00:13:33.750
The future within that,
a truth that is mine alone.

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:36.830
A dream of you!

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:38.210
Of me?

00:13:38.210 --> 00:13:39.210
Yes...

00:13:40.340 --> 00:13:44.920
You are Chrono, the person
that will take away my life.

00:13:45.920 --> 00:13:49.510
Take away your life? I'm going to?

00:13:49.510 --> 00:13:50.510
Yes...

00:13:51.220 --> 00:13:55.640
Despite that, you came here?
You continued to wait for me?

00:13:55.640 --> 00:13:58.650
I am empty, and you are going to fill me.

00:13:59.860 --> 00:14:02.520
How can you remain so calm?

00:14:03.820 --> 00:14:05.940
Because I'm with you.

00:14:06.860 --> 00:14:10.660
Seriously, you are an unusual woman.

00:14:12.580 --> 00:14:16.370
Chrono, you're wavering, aren't you?

00:14:16.370 --> 00:14:19.040
Between your role and who you are...

00:14:20.830 --> 00:14:23.170
Your dream will fail.

00:14:25.420 --> 00:14:28.380
Because you will try to not hurt anyone.

00:14:29.470 --> 00:14:34.560
Please be careful of Aion.
Even though you think of him as a friend,

00:14:34.560 --> 00:14:36.560
he does not see you as a friend.

00:14:44.730 --> 00:14:45.940
It's ready!

00:14:49.650 --> 00:14:52.740
Say, where's the head of Pandemonium?

00:14:52.740 --> 00:14:54.490
We're not doing it today.

00:14:54.490 --> 00:14:56.450
Aion! Why?

00:14:56.450 --> 00:14:59.790
The rotation of the stars
is saying that now is the time.

00:14:59.790 --> 00:15:02.750
We've even brought the Holy Woman
who has the stigmata cut into her.

00:15:02.750 --> 00:15:05.380
We have the head of Pandemonium too!

00:15:05.380 --> 00:15:08.670
We're going to begin a revolution to make
complete that which is not, aren't we?

00:15:08.670 --> 00:15:10.930
If we let this chance go...

00:15:10.930 --> 00:15:15.430
Magdalene is nothing more
than a decoy set up by God.

00:15:15.430 --> 00:15:16.430
A decoy?

00:15:17.560 --> 00:15:22.440
The Holy Woman has
been sent to make our plans fail.

00:15:22.440 --> 00:15:25.690
She told Chrono about the future.

00:15:25.690 --> 00:15:29.740
Thanks to that,
our choices have increased.

00:15:29.740 --> 00:15:33.490
Chrono, kill the Holy Woman.

00:15:33.490 --> 00:15:35.870
Fulfill your role!

00:15:43.710 --> 00:15:48.880
You knew of this fate, so why did
you come? Why didn't you struggle?

00:15:48.880 --> 00:15:50.260
No matter how much you reject it,

00:15:50.260 --> 00:15:52.590
a fate that must come cannot be changed.

00:15:52.590 --> 00:15:55.470
In that case, I at least wanted to know

00:15:55.470 --> 00:15:58.350
what kind of person was
going to take my life away.

00:16:00.140 --> 00:16:05.270
Because I fell in love with you, Chrono.

00:16:38.850 --> 00:16:40.600
Oh, it's you...

00:16:40.600 --> 00:16:42.480
Please hold on!

00:16:43.730 --> 00:16:49.190
It looks like your ability to
see events was off just this once.

00:16:49.190 --> 00:16:52.490
No! I won't let you die!

00:16:52.490 --> 00:16:57.280
The wounds are this
bad and I've lost my horns,

00:16:57.280 --> 00:17:01.040
so I can't even heal my injuries.

00:17:01.040 --> 00:17:04.830
If you need a replacement for
your horns, then there's one here.

00:17:07.960 --> 00:17:12.630
This is a contract. With my life, you will...

00:17:13.760 --> 00:17:18.510
Stop it, you live.

00:17:19.470 --> 00:17:28.650
Why you're crying... Why you'll
take away my life... Now I know.

00:17:28.650 --> 00:17:33.360
Because of our contract,
we will become one.

00:17:33.360 --> 00:17:37.950
My blood and yours
will count off time together.

00:18:01.930 --> 00:18:03.470
Oh, it's you...

00:18:03.470 --> 00:18:06.810
You love Rosette Christopher, don't you?

00:18:09.100 --> 00:18:09.980
Yeah...

00:18:10.770 --> 00:18:15.400
You're the one
fighting with destiny, Chrono.

00:18:16.610 --> 00:18:20.910
But in order to save her,
someday you'll have to kill the friends

00:18:20.910 --> 00:18:25.000
that you spoke of the same dream with.

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:28.830
Is that the inevitable
harm that you spoke of?

00:18:28.830 --> 00:18:31.080
Are you prepared to do that?

00:18:33.090 --> 00:18:35.840
I want to protect Rosette.

00:18:35.840 --> 00:18:39.380
I want to protect her
enough to cover your share!

00:18:39.380 --> 00:18:43.640
Chrono live, and...

00:18:49.980 --> 00:18:51.150
Chrono...

00:18:57.570 --> 00:18:59.070
So he's moving.

00:19:01.320 --> 00:19:04.620
Come, your sin awaits you.

00:19:10.210 --> 00:19:12.000
Oh, Chrono!

00:19:17.760 --> 00:19:20.090
Who are you?

00:19:21.010 --> 00:19:27.560
He doesn't remember. Everything,
even his power, has disappeared.

00:19:27.560 --> 00:19:29.270
Even about Rosette?

00:19:29.270 --> 00:19:30.190
Yes...

00:19:33.150 --> 00:19:34.190
Remington!

00:19:39.190 --> 00:19:45.160
Don't you think that
the cross they bear is too large?

00:19:45.160 --> 00:19:49.830
Your faith is wavering.
Is that what you wish to say?

00:19:49.830 --> 00:19:53.000
If I didn't believe,
I don't think I would be able to stand this.

00:19:57.550 --> 00:20:01.300
Let the Holy Woman go!
There's no way for you to escape anymore!

00:20:03.680 --> 00:20:05.510
As you wish...

00:20:12.310 --> 00:20:13.730
Gurio!

00:20:13.730 --> 00:20:15.150
Why you...

00:20:21.240 --> 00:20:22.650
Aion!

00:20:22.650 --> 00:20:25.740
Bastard, what did you
do to the Holy Woman?

00:20:31.080 --> 00:20:33.870
For a devil to be offering a prayer...

00:20:36.170 --> 00:20:40.170
I'll go with you. I want to
get revenge for my older sister.

00:20:42.590 --> 00:20:48.010
Ten years... It took ten years
to finally get her back, and yet...

00:20:49.970 --> 00:20:51.020
Chrono...

00:20:51.770 --> 00:20:52.930
Gurio?!

00:20:52.930 --> 00:20:55.980
Duffau's been killed.

00:20:55.980 --> 00:20:58.940
The one that killed him is your partner.

00:20:58.940 --> 00:21:01.900
Be wary of the Holy Woman's blood.
